2]},"dates":{"before":["19 May","2 May","27 Oct","27 Jan","26 Apr","12 Nov","5 Jun","10 Jan","20 May","22 May"]},"others":{"after":9},"one":{"after":0.024389035044505736},"evenOthers":{"after":253}},"picture":"You: card 1. card 2. card 10. Comparisons. 9. Chance. 2.4%. Your 9 comparisons, one square each.","drawing":"┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│                                        You: card 1\n│                               card 2  ──\n│                                       ────\n│                                       ──────\n│                                       ────────\n│             Comparisons               ──────────                        Chance\n│                                       ────────────\n│                                       ──────────────\n│                  9                    ────────────────                   2.4%\n│                              card 10  ─────────────────\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│                              Your 9 comparisons, one square each\n│"},{"step":"pairs","title":"Every pair drawn: 10 people make 45 pairs","line":"Your column of 9 is one edge of a triangle of 45.","caption":"Each newcomer can match everyone already there, so each card adds a row with one square for every card before it: 45 pairs, against your column of 9. Pairs outgrow people: doubling a room from 5 to 10 takes its pairs from 10 to 45. No square here pairs two cards with the same date. A room of 23 makes 253 pairs, enough for a better than even chance.","start":63.4,"end":89.3,"hold":64.1,"state":{"people":10,"pairs":45,"others":9,"chance":0.11694817771107768,"one":0.024389035044505736,"even":23,"evenPairs":253,"matchedPairs":[],"sharedDates":[],"doubling":[{"people":5,"pairs":10,"chance":0.02713557369979347},{"people":10,"pairs":45,"chance":0.11694817771107768}]},"changed":{"evenOthers":{"before":253},"pairs":{"after":45},"chance":{"after":0.11694817771107768},"even":{"after":23},"evenPairs":{"after":253},"matchedPairs":{"after":[]},"sharedDates":{"after":[]},"doubling":{"after":[{"people":5,"pairs":10,"chance":0.02713557369979347},{"people":10,"pairs":45,"chance":0.11694817771107768}]}},"picture":"Card 1. card 2. card 10. Pairs. 45. Chance. 11.7%. One square per pair: 10 × 9 / 2 = 45.","drawing":"┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│                                       card 1\n│                               card 2  ──\n│                                       ────\n│                                       ──────\n│                                       ────────\n│                Pairs                  ──────────                        Chance\n│                                       ────────────\n│                                       ──────────────\n│                 45                    ────────────────                   11.7%\n│                              card 10  ─────────────────\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│                             One square per pair: 10 × 9 / 2 = 45\n│"},{"step":"exact","title":"Counting exactly: person 10 must miss 9 dates already taken","line":"Predict: do 45 pairs at 1 in 365 each give the same chance?","caption":"Turn the question around: what would it take for nobody to match? Add people one at a time and ask each to miss every date taken so far. Provided earlier people have all missed, each new arrival has one fewer free date. Multiply those chances to get 88.31% for no match, then subtract from 1: 11.69% for a match. The picture shows the free dates facing person 10.","start":89.3,"end":114.8,"hold":90,"state":{"people":10,"factors":[{"person":2,"numerator":364,"denominator":365},{"person":3,"numerator":363,"denominator":365},{"person":10,"numerator":356,"denominator":365}],"noMatch":0.8830518222889223,"chance":0.11694817771107768,"occupied":9,"allowed":356},"changed":{"pairs":{"before":45},"others":{"before":9},"one":{"before":0.024389035044505736},"even":{"before":23},"evenPairs":{"before":253},"matchedPairs":{"before":[]},"sharedDates":{"before":[]},"doubling":{"before":[{"people":5,"pairs":10,"chance":0.02713557369979347},{"people":10,"pairs":45,"chance":0.11694817771107768}]},"factors":{"after":[{"person":2,"numerator":364,"denominator":365},{"person":3,"numerator":363,"denominator":365},{"person":10,"numerator":356,"denominator":365}]},"noMatch":{"after":0.8830518222889223},"occupied":{"after":9},"allowed":{"after":356}},"picture":"Person 10: 9 dates taken, 356 free.","drawing":"┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│       ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌    ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌\n│       ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌    ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌\n│       ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌    ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌\n│       ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌    ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌\n│       ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌    ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌\n│       ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌    ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌\n│       ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌    ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌\n│       ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌    ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌\n│       ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌    ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌\n│       ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌    ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌\n│       ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌    ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌\n│       ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌    ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌\n│       ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌    ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌\n│       ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌    ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌\n│       ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   ▌   